E AX3060 1301-region-bare-nullary.ax:18:12-19 region-escape "a value allocated in region `r` is stored into parameter `v` of `vecPush`, which lives in this function's own region (its caller's current region) - `vecPush` stores a value it allocates into that parameter" ^16:15-16:"this scope reclaims the stored value before the destination is used" ?"this store or call crosses a reclamation boundary: move it to the destination's outer scope, or keep the destination and every use inside the value's region; keeping another reference cannot postpone the reset"
